{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/90db98adb41aaa3cd1d5df049fbc42cf.poster.avif?t=1772578269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/90db98adb41aaa3cd1d5df049fbc42cf.webm?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/90db98adb41aaa3cd1d5df049fbc42cf.mp4?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through the zombie apocalypse in this top-down action roguelite! Take control of a deadly train, aim your primary weapon, gather resources with drone support, rescue survivors, and upgrade your firepower strategically. Unlock new locomotives, powerful weapons, and terrifying bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/5e39277c90745d4fd55b1eb3bf223636.poster.avif?t=1772578269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/5e39277c90745d4fd55b1eb3bf223636.webm?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/5e39277c90745d4fd55b1eb3bf223636.mp4?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choo Choo Survivor 2 blends horde survival and strategic upgrades in a unique experience inspired by games like <i>Vampire Survivors</i> and <i>Dome Keeper</i>, while carving out its own intense, locomotive-driven gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/64796eaedceddee6faf13dd1e4992d5e.poster.avif?t=1772578269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/64796eaedceddee6faf13dd1e4992d5e.webm?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/64796eaedceddee6faf13dd1e4992d5e.mp4?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your primary weapon is independent of the locomotive choice, so you can pick the perfect tool to crush or melt the zombie horde! Each locomotive comes with a unique auxiliary system, and you can add more during a run, allowing for a wide variety of powerful and strategic builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/12b74c491ec5b04efef09fc1f7085cb2.avif?t=1772578269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/12b74c491ec5b04efef09fc1f7085cb2.avif?t=1772578269 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each journey, you\u2019ll encounter the optional Relic Keeper boss\u2014defeat it to unlock an extra auxiliary system. Plus, visit the shop to buy an additional auxiliary system, stock up on resources, and hire survivors to strengthen your train!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/0b85f1148d0a5a20ab41aa69837c6380.avif?t=1772578269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/0b85f1148d0a5a20ab41aa69837c6380.avif?t=1772578269 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is fully destructible! Level buildings to reduce zombie spawns and clear your path to victory! Your main resources are gold, steel, and survivors, all crucial for upgrading your train. Gold can be found in crates and buildings like tombs, cabins, supermarkets, and police stations. Steel comes from metal objects such as cars, camper vans, and reinforced structures. Survivors are hidden in safe houses, and their numbers vary with each run, making every playthrough unpredictable and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/338d883a1e845024f013dec1741b2c72.avif?t=1772578269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/338d883a1e845024f013dec1741b2c72.avif?t=1772578269 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers a fresh experience with procedurally generated tracks. Choose from one of three unique journeys at the start. Go slow and steady, gather resources, upgrade your train, and prepare for escalating waves of zombies. Defeat the boss and reach the journey\u2019s end to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/cd54ba745d09f1fe5b2c467483cb5744.avif?t=1772578269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/cd54ba745d09f1fe5b2c467483cb5744.avif?t=1772578269 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience with multiple color schemes! Choose your favorite in the Settings menu. Adjust resolution, rebind keys, and 5120\u00d71440 ultra-wide monitors are supported. One handed play is supported through the Accessibility menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/ca1c23dbcb5c84fbe3f0375cd2a59a2c.avif?t=1772578269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/ca1c23dbcb5c84fbe3f0375cd2a59a2c.avif?t=1772578269 width=1560 height=886 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survivor Extractor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494210/b879d2784672d626569d73140b82b63938f574a5.jpg"},{"name":"Saviour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494210/ae9684ec3732322566fbbd59d7437f789ea23030.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Scavenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494210/facc24e6e4eb71077ad00bd518fc8dd8d4b3f952.jpg"},{"name":"Steel Scavenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494210/2d9d6e078a91f6672acc230859e99bccb9b60273.jpg"},{"name":"Zombie Tax","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494210/4eb1caaf36da0e1a29ecdc4d03e96bfe35d88b22.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Train","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494210/78f85a90bbd52cba3b2dc7412b7b75ac1bec82bb.jpg"},{"name":"Cultist Zombie Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494210/db27425be2806ca9c97b91c9118032b363a7dc5f.jpg"},{"name":"Jumper Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494210/2ee05c8af4d979136e083219525231b2055c072d.jpg"},{"name":"Wriggly Arms Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494210/aed8a6b5f769b379bb8ec8e4835d0b3e529cfb30.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodthirsty Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494210/e04458afaeed7390e6fc8d4ae3c2ceb3358ce1f9.jpg"}],"total":73},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3494210?t=1772578269","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/5c6583bc3e8575fd4e1c037173e9982427d53506/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772578269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/5ec6538fdd30b716096200aa34748490fa96d2b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772578269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/5ec6538fdd30b716096200aa34748490fa96d2b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772578269","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The player shoots down vast hordes of zombies."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/90db98adb41aaa3cd1d5df049fbc42cf.poster.avif?t=1772578269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/90db98adb41aaa3cd1d5df049fbc42cf.webm?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/90db98adb41aaa3cd1d5df049fbc42cf.mp4?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through the zombie apocalypse in this top-down action roguelite! Take control of a deadly train, aim your primary weapon, gather resources with drone support, rescue survivors, and upgrade your firepower strategically. Unlock new locomotives, powerful weapons, and terrifying bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/5e39277c90745d4fd55b1eb3bf223636.poster.avif?t=1772578269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/5e39277c90745d4fd55b1eb3bf223636.webm?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/5e39277c90745d4fd55b1eb3bf223636.mp4?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choo Choo Survivor 2 blends horde survival and strategic upgrades in a unique experience inspired by games like <i>Vampire Survivors</i> and <i>Dome Keeper</i>, while carving out its own intense, locomotive-driven gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/64796eaedceddee6faf13dd1e4992d5e.poster.avif?t=1772578269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/64796eaedceddee6faf13dd1e4992d5e.webm?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/64796eaedceddee6faf13dd1e4992d5e.mp4?t=1772578269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your primary weapon is independent of the locomotive choice, so you can pick the perfect tool to crush or melt the zombie horde! Each locomotive comes with a unique auxiliary system, and you can add more during a run, allowing for a wide variety of powerful and strategic builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/12b74c491ec5b04efef09fc1f7085cb2.avif?t=1772578269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/12b74c491ec5b04efef09fc1f7085cb2.avif?t=1772578269 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each journey, you\u2019ll encounter the optional Relic Keeper boss\u2014defeat it to unlock an extra auxiliary system. Plus, visit the shop to buy an additional auxiliary system, stock up on resources, and hire survivors to strengthen your train!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/0b85f1148d0a5a20ab41aa69837c6380.avif?t=1772578269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/0b85f1148d0a5a20ab41aa69837c6380.avif?t=1772578269 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is fully destructible! Level buildings to reduce zombie spawns and clear your path to victory! Your main resources are gold, steel, and survivors, all crucial for upgrading your train. Gold can be found in crates and buildings like tombs, cabins, supermarkets, and police stations. Steel comes from metal objects such as cars, camper vans, and reinforced structures. Survivors are hidden in safe houses, and their numbers vary with each run, making every playthrough unpredictable and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/338d883a1e845024f013dec1741b2c72.avif?t=1772578269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/338d883a1e845024f013dec1741b2c72.avif?t=1772578269 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers a fresh experience with procedurally generated tracks. Choose from one of three unique journeys at the start. Go slow and steady, gather resources, upgrade your train, and prepare for escalating waves of zombies. Defeat the boss and reach the journey\u2019s end to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/cd54ba745d09f1fe5b2c467483cb5744.avif?t=1772578269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/cd54ba745d09f1fe5b2c467483cb5744.avif?t=1772578269 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience with multiple color schemes! Choose your favorite in the Settings menu. Adjust resolution, rebind keys, and 5120\u00d71440 ultra-wide monitors are supported. One handed play is supported through the Accessibility menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/ca1c23dbcb5c84fbe3f0375cd2a59a2c.avif?t=1772578269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/ca1c23dbcb5c84fbe3f0375cd2a59a2c.avif?t=1772578269 width=1560 height=886 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["GTGD"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/69d45d657826635dc63d9da0f05ca11940cf6671/header.jpg?t=1772578269","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities.<br></li><li><strong>S